	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. a domino.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quamvis non dubitem mearum literarum frequentiam <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>tandem tibi molestam futuram, vir clarissime, tamen, quia <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>te ex animo tanquam patrem diligo, non possum non subinde aliquid <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>tecum per literas colloqui.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Ne tamen fastidium tibi pariam meis ineptiis, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>posthac singula breviter scribam.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Scio enim, quantis occupatus sis totius <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ecclesiae negotiis.<pb type="edition" next="351"/></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p18538">Imperator</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> 6. aprilis venit <placeName ref="l119">Werdam</placeName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><placeName ref="l119">Donauwörth</placeName>. - Siehe auch <bibl source="b610">Stälin</bibl> 579; <bibl source="b456">NBD</bibl> VIII 601f, Nr. 139.</note>, quo <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>etiam missi sunt consules nostri <persName ref="p3927">Welserus</persName> et <persName ref="p1410">Herbrot</persName> cum aliis senatoribus<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Außer den Altbürgermeistern <persName ref="p3927">Hans Welser</persName> und <persName ref="p1410">Jakob Herbrot</persName> begaben sich sämtliche <placeName ref="l18">Augsburger</placeName> Baumeister (Finanzverwalter) sowie <persName ref="p7046">Georg Wieland</persName>, <persName ref="p2916">Sebastian Schertlin</persName> und <persName ref="p19043">Anton Fugger</persName> nach <placeName ref="l119">Donauwörth</placeName>; s. Paul <hi>von Stetten,</hi> Geschichte der Heil. Röm. Reichs Freyen Stadt Augsburg aus Bewährten Jahr-Büchern und Tüchtigen Urkunden gezogen und an das Licht gegeben, Frankfurt/Leipzig 1743, S. 391; <hi>Roth, Augsburg</hi> III 341f; Götz von <hi>Pölnitz,</hi> Anton Fugger, Bd. 2/2, Tübingen 1967 - Studien zur Fuggergeschichte 20, S. 159.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>invitaturi eum, ut <placeName ref="l18">Augustam</placeName> veniret.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quos ille hono<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>rifice tractavit<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Ähnliches vermerkte <persName ref="p8354">Georg Frölich</persName> am 10. April 1546; s. dazu <hi>Roth, Augsburg</hi> III 364, Anm. 12.</note> et post comitia finita se venturum promisit<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Dazu kam es nicht.</note>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Aiunt <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>eum valde debilem et morbo infectum <placeName ref="l832">Gallico</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Secuti sunt eum episcopi <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>et cardinales tot, ut non imperatorem, sed papam quis dicere potuisset.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Crastina, 7. aprilis, sacramentum <placeName ref="l119">Werdensibus</placeName> imposuit, sic tamen, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ut diceret <foreign xml:lang="de">„als uns gott helff undt das heilig evangelium“.</foreign></s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Qua forma ipsi contenti fidem dederunt<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Vgl. Coelestin <hi>Königsdorfer,</hi> Geschichte des Klosters zum Heiligkreuz in Donauwörth, Bd. 2, Donauwörth 1825, S. 108; Maria <hi>Zelzer,</hi> Geschichte der Stadt Donauwörth von den Anfängen bis 1618, Bd. 1, Donauwörth 1958, S. 182f.</note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">De conventu protestantium <lb xml:id="p1z15"/><placeName ref="l569">Wormatiae</placeName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Zum <placeName ref="l1202">Schmalkaldischen</placeName> Bundestag in <placeName ref="l569">Worms</placeName> s. <ref target="file12398">Nr. 2351</ref>, Anm. 67, und <ref target="file12460">Nr. 2413</ref>, Anm. 50.</note> varia dicuntur.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Audivi ab <persName ref="p8354">archigrammatęo</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Der <placeName ref="l18">Augsburger</placeName> Stadtschreiber <persName ref="p8354">Georg Frölich</persName>.</note> <placeName ref="l491">Argentinenses</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>et <placeName ref="l513">Ulmenses</placeName> nolle interesse amplius, quae res magnum nostri<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>s et <persName ref="p3590">langrafio</persName><note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p3590">Philipp von Hessen</persName>.</note> parit dolorem<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Als <persName ref="p6733">Jakob Sturm</persName>, der <placeName ref="l491">Straßburger</placeName> Gesandte nach <placeName ref="l569">Worms</placeName>, Anfang April 1546 feststellen musste, wie viele Bundesmitglieder, besonders <placeName ref="l749">Sachsen</placeName>, keine Abgesandten schickten, zog er für einen kleinen Augenblick in Betracht, dass die oberdeutschen Reichsstädte (darunter <placeName ref="l513">Ulm</placeName>) allein, und zwar u.a. mit <placeName ref="l267">Köln</placeName>, <placeName ref="l213">Hessen</placeName> und <placeName ref="l572">Württemberg</placeName>, ein Bündnis schließen sollten; s. <bibl source="b419">Mattausch</bibl> 101. Zum Unmut <placeName ref="l491">Straßburgs</placeName> gegenüber etlichen Verbündeten s. <persName ref="p6733">Jakob Sturms</persName> Schreiben an <persName ref="p3590">Philipp von Hessen</persName> vom 27. und 28. Mai 1546 <hi>(PC</hi> IV/1 103-105).</note>.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Dissipato enim hoc foedere nihil pos<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>sunt sibi promittere quam persecutionem et bellum gravissimum.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p3590">Langrafius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>aegre omnino eorum fert detrectationem.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Convenit is una cum comite <lb xml:id="p1z20"/><persName ref="p17927">Palatino</persName><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Kurfürst <persName ref="p17927">Friedrich II. von der Pfalz</persName>.</note> caesarem <placeName ref="l471">Spirae</placeName>, et magna cum eo collocuti sunt constantia<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Zum Treffen von <persName ref="p3590">Philipp von Hessen</persName> und <persName ref="p17927">Friedrich II. von der Pfalz</persName> mit Kaiser <persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName> in <placeName ref="l471">Speyer</placeName> s. <ref target="file12453">Nr. 2406</ref>, Anm. 25, und <ref target="file12456">Nr. 2409</ref>, Anm. 21.</note>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>A <placeName ref="l471">Spira</placeName> profectus est <placeName ref="l496">Stutgardiam</placeName> ad ducem <placeName ref="l572">Wirtenbergensem</placeName>,<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">So auch <persName ref="p1055">Martin Frecht</persName> an <persName ref="p8049">Vadian</persName>, 7. April 1546 <hi>(<persName ref="p8049">Vadian</persName> BW</hi> VI 524). Der Besuch des Landgrafen in <placeName ref="l572">Württemberg</placeName> lässt sich auch aus <persName ref="p467">Bucers</persName> Brief an <persName ref="p6733">Jakob Sturm</persName> vom 15. Mai 1546 <hi>(Lenz</hi> II 438, Nr. 235) ableiten.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>a quo tantis honoribus et lachrimis etiam ut antehac nunquam acceptus <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>est.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Egit<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Subjekt des Satzes ist Herzog <persName ref="p9708">Ulrich von Württemberg</persName>.</note> apud ipsum aliquid nomine filii sui, ducis <persName ref="p1546">Christophori</persName><note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15"><persName ref="p1546">Christoph von Württemberg</persName>, damals Graf von <placeName ref="l327">Mömpelgard</placeName>.</note>.<pb type="edition" next="352"/></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/><persName ref="p1410">Herbrotus</persName> ad te scripsit,<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16">Nr. 2392 vom 24. März.</note> ut ipse mihi retulit, cupiens conciliare nos <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>cum <persName ref="p2095">Philippo</persName><note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17"><persName ref="p2095">Melanchthon</persName>. - Zu <persName ref="p1410">Herbrots</persName> Bemühungen um Verständigung zwischen deutschen und eidgenössischen Protestanten s. <ref target="file12439">Nr. 2392</ref>,22-31.</note>; sed nugae sunt.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Videmus, quid <persName ref="p467">Bucerus</persName> sua <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>effecerit concordantia:<note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" n="18">Gemeint ist die <placeName ref="l558">Wittenberger</placeName> Konkordie von 1536.</note> Nihil nisi turbas et dissidia.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Simus ergo fortes.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Constantia plus efficiemus quam ulla concordia.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Conatur ille <persName ref="p467">Vertumn<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>us</persName><note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19">Damit ist <persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> gemeint; vgl. <ref target="file12424">Nr. 2377</ref> und Anm. 14.</note> etiam aliquam cum pontificiis facere concordiam.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Sed illorum <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>pertinax obstinatia nobis est saluberrima et utilissima.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Facile enim, si vel <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>in uno cederent articulo, in vetus relaberemur fermentum<note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>1Kor 5, 7f</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Ego profecto <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>nihil tam metuo quam illas concordias.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Video a nostris tot tantaque <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>concedi, ut me tantae pudeat inconstantiae.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Sentiunt papistae nos <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>coeptae poenitere religionis ideoque tam pertinaciter resistunt.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Dominus det <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>nobis animos, ut potius moriendo vincamus quam cedendo partam <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>amittamus salutem et veritatis cognitionem.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Ego fratribus meis invisus <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>sum valde.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Invident concessam mihi a domino gratiam, tanta est inter ipsos si<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>multas ut nihil supra; quae res mihi valde molesta, cum recordor, quanta <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>apud vos<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">vos <hi>über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> sit concordia, quantus candor, quam unanimes sententiae.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Sed est haec militia, <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>in qua me vult exercere dominus.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">Ipsi honor.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div6" corresp="regest6">
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">Librum tuum de sacramentis<note xml:id="fn21" type="footnote" n="21">Zu <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> handschriftlichem Werk "De sacramentis" s. <ref target="file12379">Nr. 2332</ref>, Anm. 29.</note> tot <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>cupiunt boni amici vulgari, ut videatur iniquum esse, si non illorum satisfiat <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>votis.</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la">Rescribe ergo, quid facere velis; nisi enim aedas, plurima de meo<note xml:id="fn22" type="footnote" n="22">de meo exemplari.</note> describentur <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>exemplaria<note xml:id="fn23" type="footnote" n="23"><persName ref="p8018">Haller</persName> besaß eine Abschrift von "De sacramentis"; cramentis"; s. <ref target="file12414">Nr. 2367</ref>,28f, und <ref target="file12452">Nr. 2405</ref>,75-79.</note>.</s>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la">Ego etiam a quibusdam impellor, ut in vulgarem transferam linguam <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>propter imperitos Latinae linguae<note xml:id="fn24" type="footnote" n="24">Zu einer deutschen Übersetzung kam es nicht.</note>.</s>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la">Nihil tamen citra tuum faciam consilium.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div7" corresp="regest7">
				<p>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="la">Domini <persName ref="p8354">Laetus</persName><note xml:id="fn25" type="footnote" n="25"><persName ref="p8354">Georg Frölich</persName>.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z44"/><persName ref="p1860">Cellarius</persName><note xml:id="fn26" type="footnote" n="26"><persName ref="p1860">Michael Keller</persName>.</note> et ego sumus trias ita unita, ut non facile in nos quicquam possint <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>adversarii.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div8" corresp="regest8">
				<p>
					<s n="38" xml:lang="la">De parricida <persName ref="p4630">Diacęo</persName><note xml:id="fn27" type="footnote" n="27"><persName ref="p4630">Alfonso Diaz</persName>. - Zu dem von ihm angestifteten Mord s. zuletzt <ref target="file12460">Nr. 2413</ref> und Anm. 73.</note> nihildum audivimus, nisi quod regimentum<note xml:id="fn28" type="footnote" n="28">Die Regierung zu <placeName ref="l232">Innsbruck</placeName>; s. <hi>RTA-JR</hi> XVII 494.</note>, ut <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>vocant, tradidit illos<note xml:id="fn29" type="footnote" n="29"><persName ref="p4630">Alfonso Diaz</persName> und sein Komplize <persName ref="p6139">Juan Prieto</persName>.</note> <foreign xml:lang="de">dem landtgricht.</foreign></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div9" corresp="regest9">
				<p>
					<s n="39" xml:lang="la">Sed haec omnia raptim.</s>
					<s n="40" xml:lang="la">Boni consulas, <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>oro.</s>
					<s n="41" xml:lang="la">Ita te amo, ut finem scribendi vix possim invenire.</s>
					<s n="42" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta dilectos<pb type="scan" next="11v."/> <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>patres et dominos <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName>, <persName ref="p8171">Bibliandrum</persName>, <persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherum</persName> et familiam tuam inprimis.</s>
					<s n="43" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Si quid mittere velis,<note xml:id="fn30" type="footnote" n="30">Nämlich einen Brief; vgl. <ref target="file12436">Nr. 2389</ref>,87f, wo <persName ref="p8018">Haller</persName> <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> gebeten hatte, ihm des Öfteren zu schreiben.</note><pb type="edition" next="353"/> sicut in prioribus rogavi literis, per hunc <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>nuncium<note xml:id="fn31" type="footnote" n="31">Unbekannt.</note> facile poteris.</s>
					<s n="44" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l18">Augustae Vindelicorum</placeName>, 14. aprilis anno <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>1546.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="45" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Tuus ex animo <persName ref="p8018">Io. Hallerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse darunter:]</note>
					<s n="46" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/>Clarissimo doctissimoque <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>Bullingero</persName>, domino <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>ac patri plurimum <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>observando.</s>
					<s n="47" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z11"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>